Recommends: git
Description: Organize your git repositories by SSH profile
 Git Profiles manages SSH/Git identities straight from ~/.ssh/config. It
 switches repository remotes in bulk (with a dry-run preview) and configures the
 provider CLI (gh / gt / glab) per directory via direnv, keeping tokens in the
 keyring.
